### Routing chat (SSE)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/ai/chat/routing?memoryId=1001&message=你好
Accept: text/event-stream

### Orchestrator chat (SSE)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/ai/chat/orchestrator?memoryId=1001&message=帮我写一个科幻小说大纲
Accept: text/event-stream

### Clear session memory
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/memory/clear/1001

### Query session history
GET http://localhost:8081/api/memory/history/1001
